5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to allocate these spaces. I suggest we start by looking at the physical reality of the parking area and how people actually use it.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should avoid making decisions based on intuition. I want to understand the financial implications and what happens to those without a space.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It is important to see if the current distribution is actually fair or if it is just a matter of perception. I will look into the history.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be careful not to create a system that breeds resentment. I want to know how similar arrangements have played out in other buildings.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to help! But I want to make sure the person in charge doesn't get overwhelmed. Let's find out how much work this actually is!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I'll check the ""Morning departures watched from the entrance"" and ""Rain exposure along the parking rows"" to see the actual conditions.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine ""The building account's two-year ledger"" and ""The ward cycle park by the station.""","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I'll look into ""Five years of association minutes"" and ""Sticker register and the daily riders.""","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll investigate the ""Account from the neighbouring block's secretary"" and ""Last year's complaint log entries.""","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections"" and ""Trial of the supplier's display frame""!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
